WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.700
The unicorn charged after Tom.

2
00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:13.598
"Help!" Princess Mary yelled.

3
00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:16.284
Cat jumped in front of the unicorn.

4
00:00:16.285 --> 00:00:20.880
The unicorn tossed Cat up with her horn.

5
00:00:20.881 --> 00:00:23.070
Tom waved his wand.

6
00:00:23.071 --> 00:00:24.647
"Help Cat!"

7
00:00:24.648 --> 00:00:30.295
Poof! Bright red sparks flew out of his wand.

8
00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:35.549
"That's no help!" Tom moaned.

9
00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:39.419
The ogre in the next clearing was angry.

10
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:43.770
"Who woke me up?" he cried.

11
00:00:43.771 --> 00:00:47.605
He saw bright red sparks through the trees.

12
00:00:47.606 --> 00:00:50.252
The ogre ran toward them.

13
00:00:50.253 --> 00:00:54.366
The unicorn pointed her sharp horn at Tom.

14
00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:59.047
"No one gets away with tricking me!" she said.

15
00:00:59.048 --> 00:01:03.080
Just then the ogre crashed into the clearing.

16
00:01:03.081 --> 00:01:07.594
He roared at the unicorn.

17
00:01:07.595 --> 00:01:10.764
The unicorn groaned.

18
00:01:10.765 --> 00:01:12.955
"Not you again!"

19
00:01:12.956 --> 00:01:15.304
The ogre ran at the unicorn.

20
00:01:15.305 --> 00:01:19.424
They started to fight.

21
00:01:19.425 --> 00:01:22.189
Cat jumped into Tom's pocket.

22
00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:24.872
Tom grabbed Princess Mary's hand.

23
00:01:24.873 --> 00:01:32.407
"Run!" he said.

24
00:01:32.408 --> 00:01:36.881
They ran through the Dark Forest.

25
00:01:36.882 --> 00:01:45.055
They did not stop until they reached the castle.

26
00:01:45.056 --> 00:01:49.271
"I'm so glad to be home!" Princess Mary said.

27
00:01:49.272 --> 00:01:51.938
"Thank you for rescuing me, Tom."

28
00:01:51.939 --> 00:01:55.466
"You're welcome," Tom said, blushing.

29
00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:58.466
The king ran up.

30
00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:02.041
"Where did you go?" he asked the princess.

31
00:02:02.042 --> 00:02:04.749
"For a walk," she said.

32
00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:08.413
"Tom saved me from a mean unicorn!"

33
00:02:08.414 --> 00:02:12.735
"Tom is a wonderful wizard!" the king said.

34
00:02:12.736 --> 00:02:17.153
Tom bowed.

35
00:02:17.154 --> 00:02:25.958
Cat licked her paws.

